      <marc:subfield code="a">This innovative and visually sophisticated program will inspire young designers to innovate in their own work. Our vibrant presenter inhabits an undefined black space as he articulates concepts of innovation by drawing in the empty space about him. From here we jump off to design studios and workshops to see innovation at work. We meet the Australian team behind the EnterMo BlackBerry case as they develop an innovative approach to case design for mobile devices.</marc:subfield>
